# Decisions

Newest first. One entry per decision that was hard to make or would be expensive to reverse.

## <YYYY-MM-DD>: <decision in one line>

- **Context:** <what forced the decision>
- **Options considered:** <A, B, C>
- **Decision:** <what was chosen>
- **Why:** <the deciding reason>
- **Consequences:** <what this makes easier or harder; when to revisit>
